@startuml twoplayer-ui-before
' #7 전: 창·메뉴·시계 연결 (feature/base 1889b16). 근거: ui/LifeFrame.java:15-22, ui/GameMenu.java:15-32, application/Clock.java:43-45
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
set separator none
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title 2인용 UI 통합 전 (이슈 7): 클래식 화면만 있음

package com.holub.life.ui {
  class LifeFrame
  class BoardPanel
  class GameMenu {
    + {static} install(panel, controller, clock)
    ~ {static} go(clock, name)
    ~ {static} onTick(controller)
  }
}
package com.holub.life.application {
  class Clock {
    + addClockListener(listener)
    + start(speed) / stop() / tick()
  }
  class GameController {
    + toggle() / clear() / load() / store()
    + tick() : boolean
  }
}

LifeFrame *-- BoardPanel
LifeFrame ..> GameMenu : install
GameMenu ..> Clock : Go 메뉴, 리스너 추가
GameMenu ..> GameController : Grid 메뉴
Clock --> "listeners" GameMenu : tick → onTick → controller.tick
BoardPanel --> GameController : 클릭 → toggle

note bottom of Clock
  리스너를 뗄 수 없다.
  2인용을 붙여도 클래식 tick 리스너가 남는다.
end note
@enduml
